Third-party-derived assets (not covered by the MIT License)
------------------------------------------------------------
The 1942 board artwork and data listed below are derived from the TripleA
project's `world_war_ii_v5_1942` map package:

- `ui/board-1942.jpg` - board artwork stitched from that package's map
  tiles.
- The territory polygons, center points, and name anchors used to build
  `data/map-1942.json`.
- The game-definition data used to build `data/map-1942.json` and
  `data/scenario-1942.json` (adjacency, starting ownership, unit
  placements, and starting income).
- The source files kept under `scripts/build-map/cache/triplea/`
  (`polygons.txt`, `centers.txt`, `name_place.txt`,
  `WW2v5_1942_2nd.xml`).

